upgrade:
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "4.4.0"
    component:
      - trigger: ot_thirdparty
        description: >
          The ot_thirdparty component has been deprecated. Replacing with ot_mbedtls directly.
        remove:
          - ot_thirdparty
        add:
          - ot_mbedtls
      - script: thread/component/script/upgrade_log_config.lua
        description: >
          Projects that configure platform defined logging must include a component that provides
          ot_platform_defined_logger. If a project has no such component, ot_rtt_log is added.

  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2024.6.0"
    component:
      - trigger: ot_rcp_gp_interface
        description: >
          The ot_rcp_gp_interface component has been renamed to ot_gp_interface.
        remove:
          - ot_rcp_gp_interface
        add:
          - ot_gp_interface
    configuration:
      - script: thread/component/script/upgrade_task_priorities.lua
      - script: thread/component/script/upgrade_multipan_configs.lua
        description: >
          Enable OpenThread multiple static instance configuration options for MultiPAN application.

  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2024.12.0"
    component:
      - script: thread/component/script/upgrade_diag_config.lua
        description: >
          Diagnostic configuration support has been moved to ot_diags component.

  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2025.6.0"
    component:
      - script: thread/component/script/upgrade_sl_main_start_task_size.lua
        description: >
          SL_MAIN_START_TASK_STACK_SIZE_BYTES configuration could be added and adjusted in project files.
      - script: thread/component/script/upgrade_ot_sl_system_compatibility.lua
        description: >
          In sisdk-2025.6.0 the sl_system component was deprecated and support for baremetal applications has been removed.
          For baremetal applications sl_system_compatibility is now used for a seamless transition.
          For RTOS applications you can manually upgrade your project to sl_main or add the define SL_SUPPRESS_DEPRECATION_WARNINGS_SDK_2025_6 to your project to keep sl_system until it is removed.
          sl_system support for RTOS applications will be removed in sisdk-2026.6.0 and your project will need to upgrade to sl_main.
      - script: thread/component/script/upgrade_ncp_cli_support.lua
        description: >
          Add CLI support to NCP applications.

  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2025.12.2"
    configuration:
      - script: thread/component/script/upgrade_serial_task_stack_size.lua
        description: >
          Ensure SL_OPENTHREAD_SERIAL_TASK_MEM_SIZE is at least the required minimum in RTOS applications;
          upgrade if less, leave unchanged if greater than or equal.

  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2026.6.0"
    configuration:
      - script: thread/component/script/upgrade_multipan_instance_aware_configs.lua
        description: >
          For MultiPAN-enabled projects, enable the instance-aware logging platform API
          (OPENTHREAD_CONFIG_LOG_INSTANCE_AWARE_API_ENABLE) so logs can be attributed to the correct OpenThread instance.
      - script: thread/component/script/upgrade_mle_ip_addrs_to_register.lua
        description: >
          OPENTHREAD_CONFIG_MLE_IP_ADDRS_TO_REGISTER has been removed (OpenThread PR #12997).
          MTDs now register all valid unicast/multicast addresses unconditionally.
          Projects that override this config will fail to compile; the override is removed automatically.
